\f0\fs24 \cf0 slowDan - Vauxhall Vectra BTCC 1.1\
\
This is my version of the Vauxhall Vectra entered in the British Touring Car Championship this year. The car is run by VXR Racing for Vauxhall and constructed by Triple Eight Racing to the FIA Super 2000 rules as used in the World Touring Car Championship. I'm hoping this will be the first car in a new class for the Redline Racing League based on the same Super 2000 rules.\
\
Many thanks to X-trac for help with available gear ratios for this class of car.\
\
